{
  "title": "Salawat upon Imam al-Reza (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ عَلِيِّ بْنِ مُوسَىٰ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA A'LIYYIBNI MOOSAA\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon 'Ali the son of Musa\nالَّذِي ارْتَضَيْتَهٗ وَرَضَّيْتَ بِهٖ مَنْ شِئْتَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ\nALLADHIR TADAYTAHOO WA RADDAYTA BIHEE MAN SHI'TA MIN KHALQIK\nwhom You have accepted and through whom You have satisfied whomever of Your creatures that You wish.\nاَللَّهُمَّ وَكَمَا جَعَلْتَهٗ حُجَّةً عَلَىٰ خَلْقِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA KAMAA JA'ALTAHOO HUJJATAN A'LAA KHALQIK\nO Allah, as You have made him act as argument against Your creatures,\nوَقَائِماً بِاَمْرِكَ\nWA QAA'IMAN BI-AMRIK\nundertake the mission by Your command,\nوَنَاصِراً لِدِينِكَ\nWA NAASIRAN LIDEENIK\nsupport Your religion,\nوَشَاهِداً عَلَىٰ عِبَادِكَ\nWA SHAAHIDAN A'LAA I'BAADIK\nwitness against Your servants,\nوَكَمَا نَصَحَ لَهُمْ فِي السِّرِّ وَالْعَلَانِيَةِ\nWA KAMAA NASAHA LAHUM FIS SIRRI WAL A'LAANIYAH\nand as he acted sincerely towards them in secret and in open\nوَدَعَا اِلَىٰ سَبِيلِكَ\nWA DA-A'AA ILAA SABEELIK\nand called to Your way\nبِالْحِكْمَةِ وَالْمَوْعِظَةِ الْحَسَنَةِ\nBIL HIKMATI WAL MAW'IZATIL HASANAH\nwith wisdom and excellent exhortation,\nفَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِ\nFASALLI A'LAYH\nso also (please) bless him\nاَفْضَلَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلَىٰ اَحَدٍ\nAFDALA MAA SALLAYTA A'LAA AHAD\nwith the most favorite blessings that You have ever bestowed\nمِنْ اَوْلِيَائِكَ وَخِيَرَتِكَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ\nMIN AWLIYAA'IKA WA KHIYARATIKA MIN KHALQIK\nupon any of Your intimate servants and Your choice ones over Your creatures.\nاِنَّكَ جَوَادٌ كَرِيمٌ\nINNAKA JAWAADUN KAREEM\nVerily, You are All-magnanimous, All-generous.",
  "merits": "Among the recommended rites of Fridays, Shaykh al-Tusi, in Misbah al-Mutahajjid, records an invocation of blessings upon the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.), Lady Fatimah (s.a.) and each of the Imams (a.s.) in turn, reported from Imam al-Hasan al-'Askari (a.s.). This is its part upon Imam al-Reza (a.s.)."
}
